{"route":"/docs/6.0/forms/floating-labels/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Floating labels","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Create beautifully simple form labels that float over your input fields."},"blocks":[{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap a pair of <code>&lt;input class=&quot;form-control&quot;&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> elements in <code>.form-floating</code> to enable floating labels with Bootstrap’s textual form fields."},{"id":"example--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"A non-empty <code>placeholder</code> attribute is required on each <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> as our CSS-only floating label implementation relies on the <code>:placeholder-shown</code> pseudo-element to detect when the input is empty. The placeholder stays transparent until the control is focused, then uses the normal placeholder color. Only the <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> is shown when the field is empty and unfocused."},{"id":"example--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Also note that the <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> must come first so that screen readers announce it before the field’s value; our CSS reacts to the control’s state with the <code>:has()</code> selector."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"6e382f091d0426aa20e8","height":174,"anchors":["floatingInput","floatingPassword"]},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingInput\">Email address</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInput\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingPassword\">Password</label>\n  <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingPassword\" placeholder=\"Password\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"example--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"When there’s a <code>value</code> already defined, <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>s will automatically adjust to their floated position."},{"id":"example--example-2","type":"demo","key":"78b6496561127b8a0f63","height":300,"anchors":["floatingInputValue"]},{"id":"example--code-2","type":"code","value":"<form class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingInputValue\">Input with value</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInputValue\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" value=\"test@example.com\">\n</form>","language":""},{"id":"example--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Form validation styles also work as expected."},{"id":"example--example-3","type":"demo","key":"16c6166e002f3cce665f","height":300,"anchors":["floatingInputInvalid"]},{"id":"example--code-3","type":"code","value":"<form class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingInputInvalid\">Invalid input</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control is-invalid\" id=\"floatingInputInvalid\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" value=\"test@example.com\">\n</form>","language":""},{"id":"textareas","type":"heading","en":"Textareas","level":2},{"id":"textareas--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"By default, <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code>s with <code>.form-control</code> will be the same height as <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>s."},{"id":"textareas--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c94dcd1eb1c3b6acd82f","height":147,"anchors":["floatingTextarea"]},{"id":"textareas--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTextarea\">Comments</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Leave a comment here\" id=\"floatingTextarea\"></textarea>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"textareas--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"To set a custom height on your <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code>, do not use the <code>rows</code> attribute. Instead, override the <code>--bs-form-floating-height</code> CSS variable on the <code>.form-floating</code> wrapper (either inline or via custom CSS) so the label floats correctly at any height."},{"id":"textareas--example-2","type":"demo","key":"ad6ddb537791016ffbbb","height":147,"anchors":["floatingTextarea2"]},{"id":"textareas--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-floating\" style=\"--bs-form-floating-height: 100px\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTextarea2\">Comments</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Leave a comment here\" id=\"floatingTextarea2\"></textarea>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"selects","type":"heading","en":"Selects","level":2},{"id":"selects--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Select elements work in the same way, but unlike <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>s, they’ll always show the <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> in its floated state. <strong>Selects with <code>size</code> and <code>multiple</code> are not supported.</strong>"},{"id":"selects--example-1","type":"demo","key":"9dc0374d813f4a2789f8","height":147,"anchors":["floatingSelect"]},{"id":"selects--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingSelect\">Works with selects</label>\n  <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingSelect\" aria-label=\"Floating label select example\">\n    <option selected>Open this select menu</option>\n    <option value=\"1\">One</option>\n    <option value=\"2\">Two</option>\n    <option value=\"3\">Three</option>\n  </select>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"date-and-time","type":"heading","en":"Date and time","level":2},{"id":"date-and-time--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Date, time, datetime-local, month, and week inputs also always show the <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> in its floated state. These controls do not support placeholders the way textual inputs do, so a <code>placeholder</code> attribute is not required (and is ignored by most browsers on these types)."},{"id":"date-and-time--example-1","type":"demo","key":"28a9fab28dbde5a119cc","height":174,"anchors":["floatingDate","floatingTime"]},{"id":"date-and-time--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingDate\">Date</label>\n  <input type=\"date\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingDate\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTime\">Time</label>\n  <input type=\"time\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingTime\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"disabled","type":"heading","en":"Disabled","level":2},{"id":"disabled--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add the <code>disabled</code> boolean attribute on an input, a textarea or a select to give it a grayed out appearance, remove pointer events, and prevent focusing."},{"id":"disabled--example-1","type":"demo","key":"39521bcb22c5f3188b66","height":228,"anchors":["floatingInputDisabled","floatingTextareaDisabled","floatingTextarea2Disabled","floatingSelectDisabled"]},{"id":"disabled--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingInputDisabled\">Email address</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInputDisabled\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" disabled>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTextareaDisabled\">Comments</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Leave a comment here\" id=\"floatingTextareaDisabled\" disabled></textarea>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\" style=\"--bs-form-floating-height: 100px\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTextarea2Disabled\">Comments</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Leave a comment here\" id=\"floatingTextarea2Disabled\" disabled>Disabled textarea with some text inside</textarea>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingSelectDisabled\">Works with selects</label>\n  <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingSelectDisabled\" aria-label=\"Floating label disabled select example\" disabled>\n    <option selected>Open this select menu</option>\n    <option value=\"1\">One</option>\n    <option value=\"2\">Two</option>\n    <option value=\"3\">Three</option>\n  </select>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"readonly-plaintext","type":"heading","en":"Readonly plaintext","level":2},{"id":"readonly-plaintext--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Floating labels also support <code>.form-control-plaintext</code>, which can be helpful for toggling from an editable <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> to a plaintext value without affecting the page layout."},{"id":"readonly-plaintext--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d40ee79ddc77b2222750","height":174,"anchors":["floatingEmptyPlaintextInput","floatingPlaintextInput"]},{"id":"readonly-plaintext--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingEmptyPlaintextInput\">Empty input</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" readonly class=\"form-control-plaintext\" id=\"floatingEmptyPlaintextInput\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingPlaintextInput\">Input with value</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" readonly class=\"form-control-plaintext\" id=\"floatingPlaintextInput\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" value=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"input-groups","type":"heading","en":"Input groups","level":2},{"id":"input-groups--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Floating labels also support <code>.input-group</code>."},{"id":"input-groups--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e0b8c21ece9b265d5fc4","height":147,"anchors":["floatingInputGroup1"]},{"id":"input-groups--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"input-group\">\n  <span class=\"input-group-text\">@</span>\n  <div class=\"form-floating\">\n    <label for=\"floatingInputGroup1\">Username</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInputGroup1\" placeholder=\"Username\">\n  </div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"input-groups--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"When using <code>.input-group</code> and <code>.form-floating</code> along with form validation, place the <code>-feedback</code> outside the <code>.input-group</code> inside a <code>.form-field</code> wrapper."},{"id":"input-groups--example-2","type":"demo","key":"3001630e7d74b8be0b60","height":147,"anchors":["floatingInputGroup2"]},{"id":"input-groups--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"input-group\">\n    <span class=\"input-group-text\">@</span>\n    <div class=\"form-floating is-invalid\">\n      <label for=\"floatingInputGroup2\">Username</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control is-invalid\" id=\"floatingInputGroup2\" placeholder=\"Username\" required>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"invalid-feedback\">\n    Please choose a username.\n  </div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"always-floating","type":"heading","en":"Always floating","level":2},{"id":"always-floating--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.form-floating-always</code> to keep the label floated and show the placeholder. Use it on the <code>.form-floating</code> itself or as a wrapper around one."},{"id":"always-floating--example-1","type":"demo","key":"9499b9673035f52b6313","height":174,"anchors":["alwaysFloatingInput","alwaysFloatingPassword"]},{"id":"always-floating--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"form-floating form-floating-always\">\n  <label for=\"alwaysFloatingInput\">Email address</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"alwaysFloatingInput\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating form-floating-always\">\n  <label for=\"alwaysFloatingPassword\">Password</label>\n  <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"alwaysFloatingPassword\" placeholder=\"••••••••\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"always-floating--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"By default, placeholders stay transparent until the control is focused. With <code>.form-floating-always</code>, the placeholder stays visible in both states."},{"id":"layout","type":"heading","en":"Layout","level":2},{"id":"layout--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"When working with the Bootstrap grid system, be sure to place form elements within column classes."},{"id":"layout--example-1","type":"demo","key":"8b341fea774e16030199","height":147,"anchors":["floatingInputGrid","floatingSelectGrid"]},{"id":"layout--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"row g-2\">\n  <div class=\"md:col\">\n    <div class=\"form-floating\">\n      <label for=\"floatingInputGrid\">Email address</label>\n      <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInputGrid\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" value=\"mdo@example.com\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"md:col\">\n    <div class=\"form-floating\">\n      <label for=\"floatingSelectGrid\">Works with selects</label>\n      <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingSelectGrid\">\n        <option selected>Open this select menu</option>\n        <option value=\"1\">One</option>\n        <option value=\"2\">Two</option>\n        <option value=\"3\">Three</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Floating labels use local CSS variables on <code>.form-floating</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$form-floating-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --form-floating-height: calc(3.75rem + (var(--border-width) * 2)),\n    --form-floating-line-height: 1.25,\n    --form-floating-padding-x: calc(var(--btn-input-padding-x) * 1.25),\n    --form-floating-padding-y: 1rem,\n    --form-floating-input-padding-t: 1.625rem,\n    --form-floating-input-padding-b: .625rem,\n    --form-floating-label-height: 1.5em,\n    // Backgrounds for the textarea label's masking pseudo-element. Mirrors\n    // `.form-control` here because the label is a sibling of the control, so it\n    // can't inherit the control's own `--control-bg`/`--control-disabled-bg`.\n    --form-floating-label-bg: var(--btn-input-bg),\n    --form-floating-label-disabled-bg: var(--bg-2),\n    --form-floating-label-opacity: .65,\n    --form-floating-label-transform: scale(.85) translateY(-.5rem) translateX(.15rem),\n    --form-floating-label-disabled-color: var(--fg-3),\n    --form-floating-transition-property: \"opacity, transform\",\n    --form-floating-transition-duration: .1s,\n    --form-floating-transition-timing: ease-in-out,\n  ),\n  $form-floating-tokens\n);","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"6e382f091d0426aa20e8","html":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingInput\">Email address</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInput\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingPassword\">Password</label>\n  <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingPassword\" placeholder=\"Password\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"78b6496561127b8a0f63","html":"<form class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingInputValue\">Input with value</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInputValue\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" value=\"test@example.com\">\n</form>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"16c6166e002f3cce665f","html":"<form class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingInputInvalid\">Invalid input</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control is-invalid\" id=\"floatingInputInvalid\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" value=\"test@example.com\">\n</form>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"c94dcd1eb1c3b6acd82f","html":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTextarea\">Comments</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Leave a comment here\" id=\"floatingTextarea\"></textarea>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"ad6ddb537791016ffbbb","html":"<div class=\"form-floating\" style=\"--bs-form-floating-height: 100px\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTextarea2\">Comments</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Leave a comment here\" id=\"floatingTextarea2\"></textarea>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"9dc0374d813f4a2789f8","html":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingSelect\">Works with selects</label>\n  <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingSelect\" aria-label=\"Floating label select example\">\n    <option selected=\"\">Open this select menu</option>\n    <option value=\"1\">One</option>\n    <option value=\"2\">Two</option>\n    <option value=\"3\">Three</option>\n  </select>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"28a9fab28dbde5a119cc","html":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingDate\">Date</label>\n  <input type=\"date\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingDate\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTime\">Time</label>\n  <input type=\"time\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingTime\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"39521bcb22c5f3188b66","html":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingInputDisabled\">Email address</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInputDisabled\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" disabled=\"\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTextareaDisabled\">Comments</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Leave a comment here\" id=\"floatingTextareaDisabled\" disabled=\"\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\" style=\"--bs-form-floating-height: 100px\">\n  <label for=\"floatingTextarea2Disabled\">Comments</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Leave a comment here\" id=\"floatingTextarea2Disabled\" disabled=\"\">Disabled textarea with some text inside</textarea>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingSelectDisabled\">Works with selects</label>\n  <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingSelectDisabled\" aria-label=\"Floating label disabled select example\" disabled=\"\">\n    <option selected=\"\">Open this select menu</option>\n    <option value=\"1\">One</option>\n    <option value=\"2\">Two</option>\n    <option value=\"3\">Three</option>\n  </select>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d40ee79ddc77b2222750","html":"<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingEmptyPlaintextInput\">Empty input</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" readonly=\"\" class=\"form-control-plaintext\" id=\"floatingEmptyPlaintextInput\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating\">\n  <label for=\"floatingPlaintextInput\">Input with value</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" readonly=\"\" class=\"form-control-plaintext\" id=\"floatingPlaintextInput\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" value=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"e0b8c21ece9b265d5fc4","html":"<div class=\"input-group\">\n  <span class=\"input-group-text\">@</span>\n  <div class=\"form-floating\">\n    <label for=\"floatingInputGroup1\">Username</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInputGroup1\" placeholder=\"Username\">\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"3001630e7d74b8be0b60","html":"<div class=\"form-field\">\n  <div class=\"input-group\">\n    <span class=\"input-group-text\">@</span>\n    <div class=\"form-floating is-invalid\">\n      <label for=\"floatingInputGroup2\">Username</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control is-invalid\" id=\"floatingInputGroup2\" placeholder=\"Username\" required=\"\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"invalid-feedback\">\n    Please choose a username.\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"9499b9673035f52b6313","html":"<div class=\"form-floating form-floating-always\">\n  <label for=\"alwaysFloatingInput\">Email address</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"alwaysFloatingInput\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-floating form-floating-always\">\n  <label for=\"alwaysFloatingPassword\">Password</label>\n  <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"alwaysFloatingPassword\" placeholder=\"••••••••\">\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"8b341fea774e16030199","html":"<div class=\"row g-2\">\n  <div class=\"md:col\">\n    <div class=\"form-floating\">\n      <label for=\"floatingInputGrid\">Email address</label>\n      <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingInputGrid\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" value=\"mdo@example.com\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"md:col\">\n    <div class=\"form-floating\">\n      <label for=\"floatingSelectGrid\">Works with selects</label>\n      <select class=\"form-control\" id=\"floatingSelectGrid\">\n        <option selected=\"\">Open this select menu</option>\n        <option value=\"1\">One</option>\n        <option value=\"2\">Two</option>\n        <option value=\"3\">Three</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Install","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/install"},{"en":"AI","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/ai"},{"en":"Approach","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/approach"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/css-variables"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.c